    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Ready for the Challenge in Loopsters \u2013 A Game Like No Other!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your adventure deep in a dangerous underworld, tied together by a rope with your teammates as you try to escape. The only way out? Climb as high as you can, mastering every jump and working together to reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play alone or with friends, your goal is simple: climb out of the inferno and face the tricky worlds ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Different Environments and Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the glowing <i>Light Purple Mode</i> to the dark and spooky <i>Dungeon Mode</i>, and the shiny heights of <i>Gold Mode</i>, each world brings new obstacles. Unlock and explore different maps, each with its own challenges to keep you engaged<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435460/extras/345b06a0c95093f9085cad5f75651fd5.poster.avif?t=1734985731\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435460/extras/345b06a0c95093f9085cad5f75651fd5.webm?t=1734985731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435460/extras/345b06a0c95093f9085cad5f75651fd5.mp4?t=1734985731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun Game Modes for Everyone</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player with Checkpoints</strong>: Play solo with checkpoints to help you recover after tough falls. Move through many maps and face exciting landscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong>: Play with up to 6 friends, grouped into pairs for competitive fun! With 2 players tied together by a rope, every move matters as you work together to outclimb your opponents.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Rope Physics, True Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rope isn\u2019t just decoration\u2014it\u2019s an essential part of the gameplay! It reacts to the platforms, wrapping around and pulling you, adding an extra layer of difficulty that will test your teamwork and coordination.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Ready for the Challenge in Loopsters \u2013 A Game Like No Other!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your adventure deep in a dangerous underworld, tied together by a rope with your teammates as you try to escape. The only way out? Climb as high as you can, mastering every jump and working together to reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you play alone or with friends, your goal is simple: climb out of the inferno and face the tricky worlds ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Different Environments and Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the glowing <i>Light Purple Mode</i> to the dark and spooky <i>Dungeon Mode</i>, and the shiny heights of <i>Gold Mode</i>, each world brings new obstacles. Unlock and explore different maps, each with its own challenges to keep you engaged<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435460/extras/345b06a0c95093f9085cad5f75651fd5.poster.avif?t=1734985731\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435460/extras/345b06a0c95093f9085cad5f75651fd5.webm?t=1734985731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435460/extras/345b06a0c95093f9085cad5f75651fd5.mp4?t=1734985731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun Game Modes for Everyone</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Player with Checkpoints</strong>: Play solo with checkpoints to help you recover after tough falls. Move through many maps and face exciting landscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong>: Play with up to 6 friends, grouped into pairs for competitive fun! With 2 players tied together by a rope, every move matters as you work together to outclimb your opponents.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Realistic Rope Physics, True Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rope isn\u2019t just decoration\u2014it\u2019s an essential part of the gameplay! It reacts to the platforms, wrapping around and pulling you, adding an extra layer of difficulty that will test your teamwork and coordination.</p>",
